ing how they  recover from a series of setbacks in  recent years  in paris they hope this is the latest  stop on their journey to the top  players like liberian superstar george  weir were in the team when paris  saint-germain won the french league in  the mid-90s but they then went nearly  two decades without winning the title  until qatari money and superstar  signings like zlatan  ibrahimovic now by signing arguably the  greatest player in history lionel messi  they hope to bridge that gap and win the  best trophy of all the champions league  and perhaps become the best and most  glamorous team on the planet  paul reese al jazeera paris
 

